</div>

<h2 class="sectionedit9" id="notes">NOTES</h2>
<div class="level2">

<p>
Currently the code in lldpad reflects draft 0 of the upcoming standard. EVB TLVs on the wire can be decoded with wireshark &gt; v1.6.
</p>

</div>

